<title>USA: Carnegie Bancorp sets five percent payout.</title>
<headline>Carnegie Bancorp sets five percent payout.</headline>
<dateline>PRINCETON, N.J. 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Carnegie Bancorp said its board declared a five percent stock dividend, payable March 19, record February 12.</p>
<p>The company said this marks the eighth consecutive year where Carnegie has paid a 5% stock dividend.</p>
<p>--New York Newsdesk 212 859 1610</p>
</text>
